=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play updates/not-read ----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Auto Updates screen proposed for slice$
# 7, drawn from what real code reads of a simulated host (the$
# Auto Updates check, apt-config, dpkg, systemctl,$
# alpine.ReadUpdates), each change on the real plan/apply$
# engine: alpine.PlanUpdates and packages.PlanInstall as built,$
# the rest of each direction and the record the gallery's stand-$
# ins, unit (b)'s to build. Nothing on this machine changes:$
# every command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: updates/not-read$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. A file in apt.conf.d with a$
# syntax error: apt-config dump fails, so the row is Unknown and$
# both directions refuse.$
$
# Auto Updates #################################################$
$
  [?] Auto Updates         Unknown can't read$
                           - Counted as not configured$
$
# Update Configuration -----------------------------------------$
$
  [?] Upgrades             Can't read$
  [?] Package Lists        Can't read$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Enable automatic updates$
      Can't read$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 1$
$
# Warning$
# apt can't read its settings: Syntax error$
# /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/99site:1: Extra junk at end of file. Fix$
# that, then try again.$
$
# Auto Updates #################################################$
$
  [?] Auto Updates         Unknown can't read$
                           - Counted as not configured$
$
# Update Configuration -----------------------------------------$
$
  [?] Upgrades             Can't read$
  [?] Package Lists        Can't read$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Enable automatic updates$
      Can't read$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

